OL,3,AFears of second Nepal-Tibet flood put
OL,4,Arescuers 'on edge' as search for
OL,5,Asurvivors continues
OL,6,
OL,7,FRescuers searching for survivors in
OL,8,FNepal and Tibet are "on edge" over
OL,9,Freports that a second flood could hit
OL,10,Fthe devastated Himalayan border region,
OL,11,Fa Red Cross official tells the BBC
OL,13,FA lake of rising water has formed near
OL,14,Fthe China-Nepal border and has prompted
OL,15,Ffears it could burst its banks, reports
OL,16,FLaura Bicker in Beijing
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
