OL,3,AFears of second Nepal-Tibet flood put
OL,4,Arescuers 'on edge' as search for
OL,5,Asurvivors continues
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 900 people are missing and at
OL,8,Fleast 389 have died in Nepal after
OL,9,FWednesday's flash flooding. In Tibet,
OL,10,Fthree people have died and more than
OL,11,F550 are missing. It is not clear if the
OL,12,Flatest figures overlap
OL,14,FA collapsed glacier caused the huge
OL,15,Fflood wave, local officials tell the
OL,16,FBBC. The surge tore through houses and
OL,17,Froads, and destroyed a key Nepal-Tibet
OL,18,Fborder crossing
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
